    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{113}{630}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left[\\left(\\frac{1}{9}-\\frac{1}{10}\\right)\\div\\frac{1}{8}\\right]\\times\\frac{1}{7}+\\frac{1}{6}&=\\left[\\left(\\frac{10}{90}-\\frac{9}{90}\\right)\\div\\frac{1}{8}\\right]\\times\\frac{1}{7}+\\frac{1}{6}\\\\&=\\left(\\frac{1}{90}\\div\\frac{1}{8}\\right)\\times\\frac{1}{7}+\\frac{1}{6}\\\\&=\\left(\\frac{1}{90}\\times\\frac{8}{1}\\right)\\times\\frac{1}{7}+\\frac{1}{6}\\\\&=\\frac{8}{90}\\times\\frac{1}{7}+\\frac{1}{6}\\\\&=\\frac{8}{630}+\\frac{1}{6}\\\\&=\\frac{8}{630}+\\frac{105}{630}\\\\&=\\frac{113}{630}\\end{align*}$$",
